## THE CORE MECHANISM

This cluster is structurally different from every other cluster in the dataset. The prior clusters (serpent traditions, Terra Australis, reptilian synthesis) involved either real observed phenomena or genuine historical sources that were subsequently misinterpreted. The CERN cluster involves **the misappropriation of legitimate scientific language** — physicists speaking metaphorically, and that metaphor being received as literal by audiences with no physics context.

The mechanism is documented and named by the physicists themselves.

