| Sub-claim | Evidence Class | Primary Mechanism |
|---|---|---|
| LHC opens portals to other dimensions | E | Physics metaphor stripped of context |
| Satanic/occult rituals at CERN | E | Hoax video + statue pareidolia |
| CERN logo contains 666 | E | Logo pareidolia / apophenia |
| LHC will create dangerous black holes | E | Astrophysical argument definitively contradicts |
| CERN causes Mandela Effect | E | False memory psychology; no timeline correlation |
| CERN suppresses dimensional discoveries | E | No predicted evidence traces found |

**Key structural finding:** The CERN cluster is the only cluster in this dataset where the contamination source is **legitimate scientific language** rather than ancient texts, fringe publications, or fiction. The mechanism is language decontextualization, not misinterpretation of historical evidence.

**HYP-007 (new):** When technical scientific vocabulary overlaps with mythological vocabulary (portal, gateway, dimension, black hole), lay audiences receiving the technical term without the formal definition will default to the mythological meaning. This is not stupidity — it is the normal operation of language schema. The solution is definition-first communication, not science communication that buries definitions in jargon.

